{%- comment -%}
  What a system is made of, for the collection pages: "fibre,fibre~quality quality".
  Found by the product's template (its own fibres), then by its handle. Generated from the
  product templates: a new template's fibres appear here at the next build.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign k = key | default: handle
  case k
    when 'amalfi'
      echo 'Silk,Cheviot Wool,Cotton,Ingeo~breathability softness support~Silk:softness|Cheviot Wool:support|Cotton:breathability'
    when 'bellagio'
      echo 'Yak Hair,Cheviot Wool,Linen,Ingeo~breathability softness support temperature~Yak Hair:temperature softness|Cheviot Wool:support|Linen:breathability'
    when 'bellini'
      echo 'Silk,Horsehair,Cheviot Wool,Falkland Wool,Linen,Cotton,Ingeo,Orange Fiber~breathability softness support~Silk:softness|Horsehair:support breathability|Cheviot Wool:support'
    when 'brera'
